docs {
  `DriverResource.createDriver` in plutus-java `src/main/java/com/vahn/plutus/common/controller/DriverResource.java:232`.
  Roles: VAHN_ADMIN, TORG_ADMIN, TRUCK_MANAGER, FUND_MANAGER.
  Risk: write.
  Body: `DriverDTO`.
}
